{
	"version": 1,
	"about": "Renderer data for RLHeadPortraitMap: how a Human's saved appearance (PortraitCustomization PC/1-PC/2 fields and palette indices) becomes the RL head at High. Changing it changes every Human at High equally (players, NPCs, legacy saves); it is never sent on the wire.",
	"controls": {
		"about": "x = clamp(gain * (v - c) / 50, -cap, cap), c = the field's value in HumanPortraitPresets Rowan (male) / Mira (female). Gains per body sex from tests/rl_head_gain_probe.gd (2026-10-27): |gain| matches the RL control's displacement per slider unit to the Low/Medium sculpt's near the centre (95th-percentile magnitudes, mean of both directions); eye_size and its eyelid coupling by joint least squares. eye_tilt is negative: RL eye_tilt + raises the inner corners, the Low/Medium slider the outer ones. Secondary couplings are the plan's (jaw, nose, face_length, brow_depth) and the probe's (eye_size -> eyelid).",
		"cap": 1.0,
		"primary": {
			"jaw": {"control": "jaw_width", "gain": {"female": 0.99, "male": 0.95}},
			"cheekbones": {"control": "cheekbones", "gain": {"female": 1.8, "male": 1.72}},
			"nose": {"control": "nose_depth", "gain": {"female": 1.07, "male": 0.96}},
			"face_length": {"control": "chin_length", "gain": {"female": 0.9, "male": 1.01}},
			"eye_size": {"control": "eye_size", "gain": {"female": 0.99, "male": 1.09}},
			"eye_tilt": {"control": "eye_tilt", "gain": {"female": -0.93, "male": -0.85}},
			"eye_spacing": {"control": "eye_spacing", "gain": {"female": 1.21, "male": 1.08}},
			"nose_width": {"control": "nose_width", "gain": {"female": 0.58, "male": 0.6}},
			"lip_fullness": {"control": "lip_fullness", "gain": {"female": 1.21, "male": 1.06}},
			"brow_depth": {"control": "brow_ridge", "gain": {"female": 1.15, "male": 1.09}}
		},
		"secondary": [
			{"field": "jaw", "control": "chin_width", "gain": 0.3},
			{"field": "nose", "control": "nose_bridge", "gain": 0.4},
			{"field": "face_length", "control": "nose_length", "gain": 0.5},
			{"field": "brow_depth", "control": "brow_height", "gain": -0.2},
			{"field": "eye_size", "control": "eyelid", "gain": 0.98}
		],
		"v3Gains": {"eyelid": 1.0, "eye_style": 1.0, "eye_depth": 1.0, "brow_height": 1.0, "nose_length": 1.0, "nose_bridge": 1.0, "nose_tip": 1.0,
